{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"REM Skapa en testfil\nOPEN OUT 1, \u0022names.txt\u0022\nPRINT #1, \u0022Anna\u0022\nPRINT #1, \u0022Erik\u0022\nPRINT #1, \u0022Lisa\u0022\nCLOSE 1\n\nREM L\u00E4s alla rader tills filen \u00E4r slut\nOPEN IN 2, \u0022names.txt\u0022\n\nWHILE EOF(2) = 0\n    INPUT #2, name$\n    PRINT \u0022Name: \u0022 \u0026 name$\nWEND\n\nCLOSE 2\n\nREM Alternativ med IF\nOPEN IN 3, \u0022data.txt\u0022\n\nIF EOF(3) = 0 THEN\n    INPUT #3, value$\n    PRINT value$\nELSE\n    PRINT \u0022Filen \u00E4r tom eller slut\u0022\nENDIF\n\nCLOSE 3\n\nREM R\u00E4kna antal rader i en fil\nOPEN IN 4, \u0022file.txt\u0022\ncount = 0\n\nWHILE EOF(4) = 0\n    INPUT #4, line$\n    INC count\nWEND\n\nCLOSE 4\nPRINT \u0022Antal rader: \u0022 \u0026 count","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}